  "release_notes": "Maintenance and fixes.\n\n- macOS: fixes the celebratory \"Ready\" animations not appearing after a fresh install. The macOS installer was missing the animation files it needed to copy, so animations were silently disabled on new Macs. Fresh installs now include them.\n\n- Windows: the uninstaller is now delivered through the normal update path, so future fixes to it reach you without a full reinstall.\n\n- Trimmed leftover legacy files and unused code to keep the app lean. No change to how you use the app.",
